{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet God - A simple, aesthetically pleasing puzzle game themed around goddesses. It features the daily lives of five beautiful and adorable goddesses, accompanied by relaxing music. After completing a level, you can view their photos in the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game offers three puzzle difficulty levels: 2x2, 2x4, and 4x4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Press the &quot;F&quot; key to switch to black and white while solving a puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Press the &quot;Space&quot; key to complete the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In the gallery, quickly scroll through the girls' photos by pressing the A, B, C, D, or left/right arrow keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Puzzle image size is 800x960 px</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Gallery image size is 1088x960 px</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4014120/e015d7b012eeddabcc257a7475af6d7d762410f1.jpg"},{"name":"Don't use too much, come back tomorrow~~~","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4014120/4afc834a9ff9209e6608c160685832d788dc6938.jpg"},{"name":"Finally, someone has landed on the moon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4014120/2020c98e956d2504dac3da157d19cfcb7a5ad0f3.jpg"},{"name":"Come back tomorrow morning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4014120/fc22339b023fdc34f9a4f5699c69758a03d8f1d7.jpg"},{"name":"I won't lose any battle.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4014120/132920543f45416b6cca987bea8ebec0dc9e0a52.jpg"},{"name":"Am I beautiful?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4014120/f8f3d5304a5fb5d5fdbb1646a3eb05f6766d70a6.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"